  <collaboration id="Collaboration"><participant id="pool1" name="Manage Dashboard Files" processRef="manageDashboardFiles"></participant></collaboration>
  <process id="manageDashboardFiles" name="Manage Dashboard Files" isExecutable="true"><documentation>Uploads or deletes files used on dashboards, in the folder set by the 'File location' configuration variable. Uploads are checked against an extension allow-list and plain-file-name rules; if the file already exists, the initiator must confirm the overwrite. Deletes let the initiator pick from the files currently in the folder. Replaces the Upload Dashboard Files and Delete Dashboard Files workflows. Restrict who can start it to system administrators.</documentation>
